cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper.
title: >-
  ChIEDiff: chemistry-gated interaction-energy diffusion for structure-based
  3D molecular generation
abstract: >-
  A pocket-conditioned 3D diffusion model that integrates a chemistry-gated,
  Vina-derived intermolecular energy into training on predicted clean coordinates,
  and steers sampling with a learned affinity-head gradient. Includes the evaluation
  pipeline that regenerates every table in the accompanying manuscript.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: https://github.com/DannyJPark/ChIEDiff
keywords:
  - structure-based drug design
  - 3D molecular generation
  - diffusion models
  - protein-ligand interactions
  - physics-informed learning
  - gradient-guided sampling

